# A README picture of the one-shot, so the model is a neutral placeholder
# rather than the harness's own name or any vendor's: the reply is scripted,
# and the picture's alt text says so. The harness exports SHHH_MODEL before
# this line, so naming it here is what overrides it. `clear` first, so the
# capture holds the one surface and nothing from the shell before it.
clear; SHHH_MODEL=example-model $SHHH_BIN cmd 'find every process listening on a port above 8000'
